stateDiagram-v2
  state "空闲" as Idle
  state "流式输出中" as Streaming
  state "执行工具中" as ExecutingTools
  state "已中止" as Aborted
  [*] --> Idle
  Idle --> Streaming: 提示词()
  Streaming --> ExecutingTools: 发出工具调用
  ExecutingTools --> Streaming: 追加工具结果
  Streaming --> Idle: 助手停止
  Streaming --> Aborted: 中止()
  ExecutingTools --> Aborted: 中止()
  Aborted --> Idle: 结算监听器



